cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software, entirely or partially, directly or as inspiration,
  please cite it using the metadata below and consider supporting the author.
title: pre-commit-checklists
abstract: >
  Curated selections of public pre-commit hooks, packaged into checklists and
  exposed as consumer-selectable hook ids. Covers file hygiene, spelling,
  structured file linting (JSON, YAML, TOML, XML, Markdown), per-language
  checks, secrets scanning, and git branch/commit-message guards, with an
  install script and ready-to-copy consumer config templates.
authors:
